            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The suggested way to do that is [present in examples](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/848c5e8f428faf843051768e0d56104cd02aea1f/doc/mini-files.txt#L522-L537). That is, create an autocommand for `MiniFilesExplorerOpen` event and set custom bookmarks inside it.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The suggested way to do that is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/848c5e8f428faf843051768e0d56104cd02aea1f/doc/mini-files.txt#L522-L537\">present in examples</a>. That is, create an autocommand for <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFilesExplorerOpen</code> event and set custom bookmarks inside it.</p>",
